 "contributor": null, "rationale": "Whether canonical config serialization sits on the ledger's hot write path (pinned-in-hash) or in a cheap chained config side-chain. Lean: chained-version-table. Highest-value open decision; logged as vault Q26."}, {"id": "docs_doctrine_evaluator_versioning_gap", "label": "Evaluator-versioning gap", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/doctrine.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reproducing a past verdict needs rows + config-in-force + the evaluator (code) in force; the evaluator is pinned in neither D.1 arm. Current doctrine delivers input reproducibility, not verdict reproducibility."}, {"id": "docs_doctrine_kms_vs_rfc3161", "label": "KMS-signing vs RFC 3161 TSA", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/doctrine.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_doctrine_q26", "label": "Q26 \u2014 config-hash fork (OPEN)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/doctrine.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_doctrine_q27", "label": "Q27 \u2014 evaluator-versioning (OPEN)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/doctrine.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_doctrine_q28", "label": "Q28 \u2014 signature mechanism (OPEN, reverted)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/doctrine.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_doctrine_hard_rule_integrity_structural", "target": "docs_plans_project_state_audit_events", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/doctrine.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "